  "releaseNotes": "2026-09-30: SVG images are drawn as vectors. Fixed InvalidCastException with base64 images. Works in Linux containers (Docker, AWS) and Blazor WebAssembly: includes the SkiaSharp native assets for Linux (without fontconfig) and WebAssembly. Embedded Liberation Sans fallback font (SIL OFL 1.1) when the requested font is not installed, so text is always drawn. Update SkiaSharp to 4.153.0. Update DigitalDoor.Reporting to 1.18.1.\n\t\t  2025-12-15: Add support NET 10. Update dependencies.\n\t\t  2025-10-22: Update dependencies.\n\t\t  2025-06-01: Update license and dependencies.\n\t\t  2024-11-02: Improved conver mm to px. Improved convert to RGB colour. Update Nuget.\n\t\t  2024-10-10: Update Nuget.\n\t\t  2024-06-07: Update Nuget.\n\t\t  2024-05-12: First release with convert to JPG.",
